tools.help:
Examples:
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","content":"Create a replacement credential, then restart the service.","questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does rotating the credential require restarting the service?"}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","source":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does the source require restarting?"}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"evaluate","resources":{"docs":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"docs/*.md"}}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does the document require restarting?"}}}]
  }'
  octocode clasify '{"queries":[{"operation":"models"}]}'
  octocode clasify '{
    "queries": [{"operation":"sections","resources":{"file":{"tool":"localFetch","query":{"path":"src/cache.ts"}}},"questions":{"restart":{"type":"noul","instructions":"Does the target require restarting?"}}}]
  }'

Input: {"queries":[…]} for fresh calls; copy {"cursor":"…"} from a continuation.

Required fields, by operation:
  evaluate  questions, operation, content
  evaluate  questions, operation, source
  evaluate  questions, operation, resources
  models    operation
  sections  operation, resources, questions

Each form's example: octocode schema clasify --view variants

Fields: octocode schema clasify

Examples:
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{"queries":[{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts"}]}'
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{
    "queries": [{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts","ranges":[{"startLine":1,"endLine":30}]}]
  }'
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{
    "queries": [{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts","matchString":["function"]}]
  }'
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{
    "queries": [{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts","view":"compact"}]
  }'
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{
    "queries": [{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts","view":"compact","ranges":[{"startLine":1,"endLine":30}]}]
  }'
  octocode ghGetFileContent '{
    "queries": [{"owner":"bgauryy","repo":"octocode","path":"packages/octocode/src/index.ts","view":"symbols"}]
  }'

Input: {"queries":[…]} for fresh calls; copy {"cursor":"…"} from a continuation.

Required fields, by operation:
  content         owner, repo, path
  ranges          owner, repo, path, ranges
  matches         owner, repo, path, matchString
  compact         owner, repo, path, view
  compact:ranges  owner, repo, path, view, ranges
  symbols         owner, repo, path, view

Each form's example: octocode schema ghGetFileContent --view variants

Fields: octocode schema ghGetFileContent
